          1200   +0.02047  +0.03070     0.1238
          2500   +0.51513  +0.77270     0.0008
   [FAIL] 5 S = 0 at the centre; S keeps the radial symmetry form elsewhere
          exact octahedral configuration, |S| at the centre: 5.910e-17 (round-off)
          K there equals exp(s_0) I to 0e+00 -- an isotropic rescaling, no preferred direction
          random ball, |S_rr| at the centre: 3.909e-03 (Monte-Carlo, N=3e5, expected ~1/sqrt(N) = 1.8e-03)
          OFF-CENTRE S IS NOT ZERO and must not be: at 900 kpc inside the ball S_rr = +0.0042.
